<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banamex-Accival brokerage said on Monday it had raised Mexican retailer Controladora Comercial Mexicana (Comerci) to buy from a neutral recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Alfredo Diaz wrote in a research report dated August 4 the buy recommendation was based on a year-end 1998 target price of 1998 of 11.00 pesos per share.  </p>
<p>-- Diaz said the new target priced was based on &quot;the beginning of a recovery in the industry, as well as a better sales performance compared to the sector.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Comerci shares were up 20 centavos to 7.90 pesos in late trading on the Mexican bourse on Monday.</p>
<p>(( --Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
